<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Sunny Bulk - (built 1973) 26,646 dwt sold to Chinese buyers for $2.6 million.</p>
<p>COMBINATION CARRIER - Ararat - (built 1978) 84,137 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $4 million on &quot;as is&quot; basis.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Griffin Rhea - (built 1983) 23,300 dwt sold to Hong Kong buyers for $8.5 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
